      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "代价就是害皮肤变得这么粗糙……\n唉，对于自己管理不善，我深感羞愧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51851ffc9f9683e3a3ed7269ebd7c3900cf43cc87458edfb4f9691034593b543",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
